flowchart LR
    U[User] --> UI[Streamlit Web App]
    UI --> UP[PDF / TXT Upload]
    UP --> EX[PyMuPDF / Text Extraction]
    EX --> CH[Chunking]
    CH --> SUM[FLAN-T5 Small\nSummary]
    CH --> RET[TF-IDF Retriever]
    RET --> CTX[Top Relevant Chunks]
    Q[User Question] --> CTX
    CTX --> LLM[FLAN-T5 Small\nGrounded Answer]
    LLM --> OUT[Answer + Citations]
    CH --> TL[Timeline / Key Facts]
    SUM --> UI
    OUT --> UI
    TL --> UI
